sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant EDA     as Nokia EDA (Event-Driven Automation)
    participant SONIC   as SONiC Leaf Switches (SW1 + SW2 in Rack C)
    participant CAPI    as Cluster API (CAPI)
    participant Ironic  as Metal3 Ironic / PXE
    participant Node    as Bare Metal Worker Node
    participant Rafay   as Rafay SaaS Controller
    participant ArgoCD  as ArgoCD GitOps
    participant Git     as Git Repository (Blueprint)
    participant API     as kube-apiserver (RKE2)

    Note over Admin,SONIC: PHASE 0 — Switch Pre-Configuration (one-time, before any PXE boot)
    Admin->>EDA: Pushes SONiC switch config to EDA (VLANs, BGP, PFC, ECN, MLAG peer-link)
    EDA->>SONIC: EDA applies config to both SONiC leaf switches via GitOps push
    Admin->>SONIC: Admin verifies MLAG peer-link up, BGP sessions established, RoCEv2 PFC enabled

    Note over Admin,API: PHASE 1 — Metal3 Bare Metal Provisioning
    Node->>Ironic: Node is powered on — ironic-inspector discovers it via BMC/iDRAC
    Ironic->>API: Registers node as BareMetalHost CRD in Kubernetes
    Admin->>CAPI: Admin applies Machine YAML manifest via GitOps
    CAPI->>Ironic: CAPI instructs Ironic to provision the host
    Ironic->>Node: PXE boots node & installs Ubuntu OS via cloud-init
    Node->>Rafay: cloud-init auto-starts Rafay Agent — dials out to Rafay SaaS (HTTPS)
    Rafay->>Node: Rafay assigns node to the cluster and selects Blueprint (gpu-cluster-v1)
    Rafay->>ArgoCD: Rafay triggers ArgoCD sync of Blueprint from Git
    ArgoCD->>Git: ArgoCD pulls Blueprint manifest from Git repository
    Git-->>ArgoCD: Returns Helm charts (RKE2, GPU Operator, Cilium, KubeFlow, KAI)
    ArgoCD->>API: ArgoCD applies manifests to cluster (in order: CNI → GPU Operator → Platform)
    API->>Node: Kubernetes schedules GPU Operator DaemonSet on new node
    Node->>Node: GPU Operator installs NVIDIA drivers + DCGM + mig-parted on node
    API->>Node: Kubernetes schedules Cilium DaemonSet — networking is ready
    Rafay->>Admin: Node is Ready — Rafay dashboard shows green health status
    Admin->>Rafay: Admin creates tenant Project in Rafay → namespace + KAI Queue auto-provisioned
